          "id": "code-ml-22-1-ch22_1_sklearn",
          "title": "Scikit-Learn 1.9 & SciPy: Efek Chaining Single Linkage vs Complete/Average/Ward & distance_threshold",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "22_1_sklearn_chaining_and_threshold.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom scipy.cluster.hierarchy import cophenet, linkage\nfrom scipy.spatial.distance import pdist\nfrom sklearn.cluster import AgglomerativeClustering\nfrom sklearn.metrics import adjusted_rand_score, silhouette_score\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(222)\n\n# Bangkitkan 2 klaster Gaussian rapi (100 titik/klaster) + 8 titik jembatan tipis + 1 outlier moderat (chaining trap!)\nc0 = rng.normal(loc=[-2.8, 0.0], scale=0.55, size=(100, 2))\nc1 = rng.normal(loc=[2.8, 0.0], scale=0.55, size=(100, 2))\nbridge = np.column_stack([np.linspace(-1.7, 1.7, 8), rng.normal(0.0, 0.04, size=8)])\nfar_outlier = np.array([[0.0, 3.2]])\n\nX_chain = np.vstack([c0, c1, bridge, far_outlier])\ny_core = np.array([0] * 100 + [1] * 100)  # Ground truth untuk 200 titik klaster sejati\n\nd_cond = pdist(X_chain, metric=\"euclidean\")\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Efek Chaining Single Linkage vs Complete/Average/Ward (2 Klaster + Jembatan + 1 Outlier) ===\")\nprint(\"Linkage  | Ukuran Klaster (K=2) | ARI (200 Core) | Silhouette | Cophenetic r\")\nprint(\"-\" * 76)\nfor link in [\"single\", \"complete\", \"average\", \"ward\"]:\n    model = AgglomerativeClustering(n_clusters=2, linkage=link, metric=\"euclidean\")\n    labels = model.fit_predict(X_chain)\n    counts = sorted(np.bincount(labels).tolist(), reverse=True)\n    ari = float(adjusted_rand_score(y_core, labels[:200]))\n    sil = float(silhouette_score(X_chain, labels))\n    cpcc = float(cophenet(linkage(d_cond, method=link), d_cond)[0])\n    print(f\"{link:8s} | {str(counts):20s} | {ari:14.4f} | {sil:10.4f} | {cpcc:12.4f}\")\n\n# 2) Pemotongan Dendrogram Otomatis Menggunakan distance_threshold (Tanpa Menetapkan K di Awal!)\nX_multi = np.vstack([\n    rng.normal([0.0, 0.0], 0.55, size=(70, 2)),\n    rng.normal([4.5, 0.2], 0.60, size=(70, 2)),\n    rng.normal([2.2, 4.0], 0.55, size=(70, 2)),\n    rng.normal([7.0, 3.8], 0.60, size=(70, 2)),\n])\ny_multi = np.repeat(np.arange(4), 70)\n\n# Inspeksi 6 jarak penggabungan terakhir pada pohon Ward penuh untuk mendeteksi lompatan terbesar\nfull_ward = AgglomerativeClustering(n_clusters=None, distance_threshold=0.0, linkage=\"ward\").fit(X_multi)\nlast_merges = full_ward.distances_[-6:]\ngaps = np.diff(last_merges)\nbest_gap_idx = int(np.argmax(gaps))\nauto_thresh = float(0.5 * (last_merges[best_gap_idx] + last_merges[best_gap_idx + 1]))\n\ncut_ward = AgglomerativeClustering(n_clusters=None, distance_threshold=auto_thresh, linkage=\"ward\").fit(X_multi)\nari_auto = float(adjusted_rand_score(y_multi, cut_ward.labels_))\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Pemotongan Dendrogram Ward via distance_threshold (Deteksi Lompatan Merge Terbesar) ===\")\nprint(f\"6 Tinggi Merge Terakhir Ward : {[round(float(v), 2) for v in last_merges]}\")\nprint(f\"Ambang Potong Tengah Gap     : distance_threshold = {auto_thresh:.2f}\")\nprint(f\"Klaster Ditemukan Otomatis   : K = {cut_ward.n_clusters_} (True K = 4) | ARI = {ari_auto:.4f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Efek Chaining Single Linkage vs Complete/Average/Ward (2 Klaster + Jembatan + 1 Outlier) ===\nLinkage  | Ukuran Klaster (K=2) | ARI (200 Core) | Silhouette | Cophenetic r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nsingle   | [208, 1]             |         0.0000 |     0.2193 |       0.4830\ncomplete | [107, 102]           |         1.0000 |     0.7924 |       0.9365\naverage  | [108, 101]           |         1.0000 |     0.7851 |       0.9433\nward     | [107, 102]           |         1.0000 |     0.7924 |       0.9408\n\n=== 2. Pemotongan Dendrogram Ward via distance_threshold (Deteksi Lompatan Merge Terbesar) ===\n6 Tinggi Merge Terakhir Ward : [5.3, 5.43, 5.76, 36.59, 39.61, 55.09]\nAmbang Potong Tengah Gap     : distance_threshold = 21.17\nKlaster Ditemukan Otomatis   : K = 4 (True K = 4) | ARI = 1.0000",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Efek Chaining Single Linkage vs Complete/Average/Ward (2 Klaster + Jembatan + 1 Outlier) ===\nLinkage  | Ukuran Klaster (K=2) | ARI (200 Core) | Silhouette | Cophenetic r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------\nsingle   | [208, 1]             |         0.0000 |     0.2193 |       0.4830\ncomplete | [107, 102]           |         1.0000 |     0.7924 |       0.9365\naverage  | [108, 101]           |         1.0000 |     0.7851 |       0.9433\nward     | [107, 102]           |         1.0000 |     0.7924 |       0.9408\n\n=== 2. Pemotongan Dendrogram Ward via distance_threshold (Deteksi Lompatan Merge Terbesar) ===\n6 Tinggi Merge Terakhir Ward : [5.3, 5.43, 5.76, 36.59, 39.61, 55.09]\nAmbang Potong Tengah Gap     : distance_threshold = 21.17\nKlaster Ditemukan Otomatis   : K = 4 (True K = 4) | ARI = 1.0000",
          "explanation": "Mendemonstrasikan kejatuhan ARI Single Linkage ke 0.0000 akibat jembatan 8 titik + 1 outlier saat Complete/Average/Ward mempertahankan ARI 1.0000, lalu memotong dendrogram Ward secara otomatis melalui lompatan terbesar distance_threshold.",
          "verificationStatus": "VERIFIED_RUNNABLE",
