          "id": "code-ml-22-1-ch22_1_diag",
          "title": "Production Audit: Ledakan RAM O(N^2), Sparse kNN Connectivity pada Two-Moons & Proxy NearestCentroid",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "22_1_ram_connectivity_proxy_audit.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.cluster import AgglomerativeClustering\nfrom sklearn.datasets import make_moons\nfrom sklearn.metrics import adjusted_rand_score\nfrom sklearn.neighbors import NearestCentroid, kneighbors_graph\n\n# 1) Audit Batas Memori O(N^2) Matriks Jarak Condensed (float64) vs Skala Produksi\nprint(\"=== 1. Audit Footprint RAM Matriks Jarak Berpasangan Agglomerative (float64) ===\")\nprint(\"Jumlah Sampel N | Pasangan N(N-1)/2 | RAM Condensed (GB) | RAM Dense NxN (GB) | Status Produksi\")\nprint(\"-\" * 97)\nfor N in [1_000, 10_000, 50_000, 100_000, 1_000_000]:\n    pairs = N * (N - 1) // 2\n    ram_cond_gb = (pairs * 8) / (1024 ** 3)\n    ram_dense_gb = (N * N * 8) / (1024 ** 3)\n    status = \"Cepat (Laptop)\" if ram_cond_gb < 1.0 else (\"Batas Server\" if ram_cond_gb < 16.0 else \"OOM CRASH!\")\n    print(f\"{N:15,d} | {pairs:17,d} | {ram_cond_gb:18.4f} | {ram_dense_gb:18.4f} | {status}\")\n\n# 2) Ward Tanpa Kendala vs Agglomerative + Sparse kNN Connectivity Graph pada Manifold Two-Moons\nX_m, y_m = make_moons(n_samples=400, noise=0.05, random_state=42)\n\nward_plain = AgglomerativeClustering(n_clusters=2, linkage=\"ward\")\nlbl_plain = ward_plain.fit_predict(X_m)\n\nconn_knn = kneighbors_graph(X_m, n_neighbors=8, include_self=False)\nconn_sym = 0.5 * (conn_knn + conn_knn.T)  # Simetrikan graf konektivitas\nward_conn = AgglomerativeClustering(n_clusters=2, linkage=\"ward\", connectivity=conn_sym)\nlbl_ward_conn = ward_conn.fit_predict(X_m)\navg_conn = AgglomerativeClustering(n_clusters=2, linkage=\"average\", connectivity=conn_sym)\nlbl_avg_conn = avg_conn.fit_predict(X_m)\n\nnnz_ratio = 100.0 * conn_sym.nnz / (X_m.shape[0] ** 2)\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Agglomerative Tanpa Kendala vs Sparse kNN Connectivity pada Two-Moons (N=400) ===\")\nprint(f\"Ward Standar (Tanpa Connectivity)           | ARI = {adjusted_rand_score(y_m, lbl_plain):.4f}  <-- Membelah bulan sabit secara lurus!\")\nprint(f\"Ward + Sparse kNN Graph (k=8, nnz={nnz_ratio:4.1f}%)    | ARI = {adjusted_rand_score(y_m, lbl_ward_conn):.4f}  <-- Minimisasi varians masih memotong busur panjang!\")\nprint(f\"Average + Sparse kNN Graph (k=8, nnz={nnz_ratio:4.1f}%) | ARI = {adjusted_rand_score(y_m, lbl_avg_conn):.4f}  <-- Mengikuti topologi manifold sempurna!\")\n\n# 3) Audit Out-of-Sample Inference: Agglomerative Tidak Punya .predict() -> Pola Proxy NearestCentroid\nrng = np.random.default_rng(223)\nX_tr = np.vstack([rng.normal([0, 0], 0.6, (90, 2)), rng.normal([3.5, 3.0], 0.6, (90, 2))])\ny_tr_true = np.array([0] * 90 + [1] * 90)\nX_te = np.vstack([rng.normal([0, 0], 0.6, (30, 2)), rng.normal([3.5, 3.0], 0.6, (30, 2))])\ny_te_true = np.array([0] * 30 + [1] * 30)\n\nagg = AgglomerativeClustering(n_clusters=2, linkage=\"ward\").fit(X_tr)\nhas_predict = hasattr(agg, \"predict\")\nproxy = NearestCentroid(metric=\"euclidean\").fit(X_tr, agg.labels_)\ny_te_pred = proxy.predict(X_te)\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 3. Audit Inferensi Out-of-Sample pada AgglomerativeClustering ===\")\nprint(f\"hasattr(AgglomerativeClustering, 'predict') = {has_predict} (Wajib proxy classifier untuk inferensi online!)\")\nprint(f\"Train ARI = {adjusted_rand_score(y_tr_true, agg.labels_):.4f} | Out-of-Sample Test ARI via NearestCentroid = {adjusted_rand_score(y_te_true, y_te_pred):.4f}\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Audit Footprint RAM Matriks Jarak Berpasangan Agglomerative (float64) ===\nJumlah Sampel N | Pasangan N(N-1)/2 | RAM Condensed (GB) | RAM Dense NxN (GB) | Status Produksi\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n          1,000 |           499,500 |             0.0037 |             0.0075 | Cepat (Laptop)\n         10,000 |        49,995,000 |             0.3725 |             0.7451 | Cepat (Laptop)\n         50,000 |     1,249,975,000 |             9.3130 |            18.6265 | Batas Server\n        100,000 |     4,999,950,000 |            37.2525 |            74.5058 | OOM CRASH!\n      1,000,000 |   499,999,500,000 |          3725.2866 |          7450.5806 | OOM CRASH!\n\n=== 2. Agglomerative Tanpa Kendala vs Sparse kNN Connectivity pada Two-Moons (N=400) ===\nWard Standar (Tanpa Connectivity)           | ARI = 0.4818  <-- Membelah bulan sabit secara lurus!\nWard + Sparse kNN Graph (k=8, nnz= 2.4%)    | ARI = 0.4818  <-- Minimisasi varians masih memotong busur panjang!\nAverage + Sparse kNN Graph (k=8, nnz= 2.4%) | ARI = 1.0000  <-- Mengikuti topologi manifold sempurna!\n\n=== 3. Audit Inferensi Out-of-Sample pada AgglomerativeClustering ===\nhasattr(AgglomerativeClustering, 'predict') = False (Wajib proxy classifier untuk inferensi online!)\nTrain ARI = 1.0000 | Out-of-Sample Test ARI via NearestCentroid = 1.0000",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Audit Footprint RAM Matriks Jarak Berpasangan Agglomerative (float64) ===\nJumlah Sampel N | Pasangan N(N-1)/2 | RAM Condensed (GB) | RAM Dense NxN (GB) | Status Produksi\n-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n          1,000 |           499,500 |             0.0037 |             0.0075 | Cepat (Laptop)\n         10,000 |        49,995,000 |             0.3725 |             0.7451 | Cepat (Laptop)\n         50,000 |     1,249,975,000 |             9.3130 |            18.6265 | Batas Server\n        100,000 |     4,999,950,000 |            37.2525 |            74.5058 | OOM CRASH!\n      1,000,000 |   499,999,500,000 |          3725.2866 |          7450.5806 | OOM CRASH!\n\n=== 2. Agglomerative Tanpa Kendala vs Sparse kNN Connectivity pada Two-Moons (N=400) ===\nWard Standar (Tanpa Connectivity)           | ARI = 0.4818  <-- Membelah bulan sabit secara lurus!\nWard + Sparse kNN Graph (k=8, nnz= 2.4%)    | ARI = 0.4818  <-- Minimisasi varians masih memotong busur panjang!\nAverage + Sparse kNN Graph (k=8, nnz= 2.4%) | ARI = 1.0000  <-- Mengikuti topologi manifold sempurna!\n\n=== 3. Audit Inferensi Out-of-Sample pada AgglomerativeClustering ===\nhasattr(AgglomerativeClustering, 'predict') = False (Wajib proxy classifier untuk inferensi online!)\nTrain ARI = 1.0000 | Out-of-Sample Test ARI via NearestCentroid = 1.0000",
