          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.cluster import DBSCAN, KMeans\nfrom sklearn.datasets import make_moons\nfrom sklearn.metrics import adjusted_rand_score\nfrom sklearn.neighbors import NearestNeighbors\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(225)\n\n# 1) Dataset Non-Konveks Two-Moons (300 titik) + 24 Outlier Seragam (7.4% kontaminasi)\nX_moons, y_moons = make_moons(n_samples=300, noise=0.065, random_state=42)\nX_outliers = rng.uniform(low=[-1.6, -1.2], high=[2.6, 1.8], size=(24, 2))\n# Pastikan outlier benar-benar di luar pita bulan sabit\nX_all = np.vstack([X_moons, X_outliers])\nX_scaled = StandardScaler().fit_transform(X_all)\n\n# 2) Kalibrasi Otomatis eps via k-Distance Knee (Jarak Tegak Lurus Maksimum ke Garis Ujung-ke-Ujung)\nd_dim = X_scaled.shape[1]\nmin_samples = max(4, 2 * d_dim + 2)  # Aturan praktis >= 2*d (d=2 -> min_samples=6)\nnn = NearestNeighbors(n_neighbors=min_samples, metric=\"euclidean\").fit(X_scaled)\ndists, _ = nn.kneighbors(X_scaled)\nk_dists = np.sort(dists[:, -1])  # Jarak ke tetangga ke-min_samples terurut menaik\n\n# Deteksi siku (Kneedle geometris pada kurva ternormalisasi [0,1])\nx_norm = np.linspace(0.0, 1.0, len(k_dists))\ny_norm = (k_dists - k_dists[0]) / (k_dists[-1] - k_dists[0] + 1e-12)\n# Jarak vertikal di bawah garis diagonal y = x (siku tajam memaksimalkan x_norm - y_norm)\nknee_idx = int(np.argmax(x_norm - y_norm))\neps_knee = float(k_dists[knee_idx])\n\n# 3) Bandingkan K-Means (K=2) vs DBSCAN Terkalibrasi pada Two-Moons + Outlier\nkm_labels = KMeans(n_clusters=2, n_init=10, random_state=42).fit_predict(X_scaled)\ndb_labels = DBSCAN(eps=eps_knee, min_samples=min_samples).fit_predict(X_scaled)\n\nari_km_moons = float(adjusted_rand_score(y_moons, km_labels[:300]))\nari_db_moons = float(adjusted_rand_score(y_moons, db_labels[:300]))\ndb_noise_total = int(np.sum(db_labels == -1))\ndb_outlier_caught = int(np.sum(db_labels[300:] == -1))\ndb_false_noise = int(np.sum(db_labels[:300] == -1))\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Kalibrasi Otomatis k-Distance Elbow (d=2, min_samples=6) ===\")\nprint(f\"Kuantil k-dist [p50, p85, p90, p95, p99] : {[round(float(np.percentile(k_dists, p)), 3) for p in [50, 85, 90, 95, 99]]}\")\nprint(f\"Titik Siku Terdeteksi (Indeks {knee_idx}/{len(k_dists)}) : eps_knee = {eps_knee:.4f}\")\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Two-Moons Non-Konveks + 24 Outlier: K-Means vs DBSCAN Terkalibrasi ===\")\nprint(f\"K-Means (K=2)            | ARI Moons={ari_km_moons:.4f} | Outlier Ditolak= 0/24 (Dipaksa masuk klaster!)\")\nprint(f\"DBSCAN (eps={eps_knee:.3f}, m={min_samples})| ARI Moons={ari_db_moons:.4f} | Klaster={len(set(db_labels)-{-1})} | Outlier Ditolak={db_outlier_caught}/24 | False Noise={db_false_noise}/300 (Total -1={db_noise_total})\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Kalibrasi Otomatis k-Distance Elbow (d=2, min_samples=6) ===\nKuantil k-dist [p50, p85, p90, p95, p99] : [0.145, 0.201, 0.233, 0.369, 1.326]\nTitik Siku Terdeteksi (Indeks 303/324) : eps_knee = 0.2751\n\n=== 2. Two-Moons Non-Konveks + 24 Outlier: K-Means vs DBSCAN Terkalibrasi ===\nK-Means (K=2)            | ARI Moons=0.4697 | Outlier Ditolak= 0/24 (Dipaksa masuk klaster!)\nDBSCAN (eps=0.275, m=6)| ARI Moons=1.0000 | Klaster=2 | Outlier Ditolak=17/24 | False Noise=0/300 (Total -1=17)",
