          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.cluster import DBSCAN, HDBSCAN\nfrom sklearn.metrics import adjusted_rand_score\nfrom sklearn.neighbors import NearestNeighbors\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(226)\n\n# 1) BENCANA ANTI-PATTERN: DBSCAN(eps=0.5) Tanpa StandardScaler pada Fitur Skala Campuran (Rupiah & Frekuensi)\nn_seg = 120\nX_tx = np.vstack([\n    np.column_stack([rng.normal(250_000, 45_000, n_seg), rng.normal(12.0, 2.0, n_seg)]),     # Segmen ritel kecil\n    np.column_stack([rng.normal(4_500_000, 350_000, n_seg), rng.normal(4.0, 1.0, n_seg)]),  # Segmen korporat\n    np.column_stack([rng.normal(1_800_000, 180_000, n_seg), rng.normal(28.0, 3.0, n_seg)]), # Segmen reseller aktif\n])\ny_tx = np.repeat(np.arange(3), n_seg)\n\n# Anti-pattern: DBSCAN langsung pada skala mentah (eps=0.5 default!)\nlbl_raw = DBSCAN(eps=0.5, min_samples=6).fit_predict(X_tx)\npct_noise_raw = 100.0 * float(np.mean(lbl_raw == -1))\n\n# Production-safe: StandardScaler + k-distance elbow\nX_tx_s = StandardScaler().fit_transform(X_tx)\nkd = np.sort(NearestNeighbors(n_neighbors=6).fit(X_tx_s).kneighbors(X_tx_s)[0][:, -1])\neps_safe = float(np.percentile(kd, 96))\nlbl_safe = DBSCAN(eps=eps_safe, min_samples=6).fit_predict(X_tx_s)\n\nprint(\"=== 1. Audit Bencana DBSCAN(eps=0.5) Tanpa Scaling vs StandardScaler + Kalibrasi ===\")\nprint(f\"DBSCAN Mentah (eps=0.5)            | Klaster={len(set(lbl_raw)-{-1})} | Noise={pct_noise_raw:6.2f}% | ARI={adjusted_rand_score(y_tx, lbl_raw):.4f}  <-- HANCUR!\")\nprint(f\"StandardScaler + DBSCAN (eps={eps_safe:.2f}) | Klaster={len(set(lbl_safe)-{-1})} | Noise={100*np.mean(lbl_safe==-1):6.2f}% | ARI={adjusted_rand_score(y_tx, lbl_safe):.4f}  <-- PULIH!\")\n\n# 2) KELEMAHAN FUNDAMENTAL DBSCAN: Klaster dengan Kepadatan Sangat Bervariasi (Varying Densities)\n#    2 klaster SUPER RAPAT berdekatan (sigma=0.14, jarak pusat=0.95) + 1 klaster SANGAT RENGGANG (sigma=1.15)\nX_var = np.vstack([\n    rng.normal([0.0, 0.0], 0.14, size=(120, 2)),     # Klaster 0: sangat rapat\n    rng.normal([0.95, 0.0], 0.14, size=(120, 2)),    # Klaster 1: sangat rapat, dekat klaster 0\n    rng.normal([5.8, 1.5], 1.15, size=(120, 2)),     # Klaster 2: 8x lebih renggang!\n])\ny_var = np.repeat(np.arange(3), 120)\n\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Audit Ketidakmampuan DBSCAN Global eps pada Klaster Ber-Densitas Bervariasi ===\")\nprint(\"Metode / Parameter             | Klaster | Noise Klaster-2 (Renggang) | ARI Total | Diagnosis\")\nprint(\"-\" * 96)\nfor eps_val in [0.16, 0.30, 0.55, 0.95]:\n    lbl = DBSCAN(eps=eps_val, min_samples=8).fit_predict(X_var)\n    k_found = len(set(lbl) - {-1})\n    noise_c2 = 100.0 * float(np.mean(lbl[240:] == -1))\n    ari = float(adjusted_rand_score(y_var, lbl))\n    if noise_c2 > 50:\n        diag = \"Klaster renggang dibuang jadi noise!\"\n    elif k_found < 3:\n        diag = \"Klaster rapat 0 & 1 melebur jadi satu!\"\n    else:\n        diag = \"Kompromi rapuh / parsial\"\n    print(f\"DBSCAN(eps={eps_val:4.2f}, min_s=8)       | {k_found:7d} | {noise_c2:25.1f}% | {ari:9.4f} | {diag}\")\n\nhdb_lbl = HDBSCAN(min_cluster_size=25, min_samples=8, copy=False).fit_predict(X_var)\nprint(f\"HDBSCAN(min_cl=25, min_s=8)    | {len(set(hdb_lbl)-{-1}):7d} | {100*np.mean(hdb_lbl[240:]==-1):25.1f}% | {adjusted_rand_score(y_var, hdb_lbl):9.4f} | Menang lintas densitas tanpa eps!\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Audit Bencana DBSCAN(eps=0.5) Tanpa Scaling vs StandardScaler + Kalibrasi ===\nDBSCAN Mentah (eps=0.5)            | Klaster=0 | Noise=100.00% | ARI=0.0000  <-- HANCUR!\nStandardScaler + DBSCAN (eps=0.17) | Klaster=3 | Noise=  1.11% | ARI=0.9832  <-- PULIH!\n\n=== 2. Audit Ketidakmampuan DBSCAN Global eps pada Klaster Ber-Densitas Bervariasi ===\nMetode / Parameter             | Klaster | Noise Klaster-2 (Renggang) | ARI Total | Diagnosis\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nDBSCAN(eps=0.16, min_s=8)       |       2 |                     100.0% |    0.9833 | Klaster renggang dibuang jadi noise!\nDBSCAN(eps=0.30, min_s=8)       |       1 |                     100.0% |    0.5701 | Klaster renggang dibuang jadi noise!\nDBSCAN(eps=0.55, min_s=8)       |       2 |                      41.7% |    0.4460 | Klaster rapat 0 & 1 melebur jadi satu!\nDBSCAN(eps=0.95, min_s=8)       |       2 |                       6.7% |    0.5392 | Klaster rapat 0 & 1 melebur jadi satu!\nHDBSCAN(min_cl=25, min_s=8)    |       3 |                       0.0% |    0.9792 | Menang lintas densitas tanpa eps!",
          "actualOutput": "=== 1. Audit Bencana DBSCAN(eps=0.5) Tanpa Scaling vs StandardScaler + Kalibrasi ===\nDBSCAN Mentah (eps=0.5)            | Klaster=0 | Noise=100.00% | ARI=0.0000  <-- HANCUR!\nStandardScaler + DBSCAN (eps=0.17) | Klaster=3 | Noise=  1.11% | ARI=0.9832  <-- PULIH!\n\n=== 2. Audit Ketidakmampuan DBSCAN Global eps pada Klaster Ber-Densitas Bervariasi ===\nMetode / Parameter             | Klaster | Noise Klaster-2 (Renggang) | ARI Total | Diagnosis\n------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nDBSCAN(eps=0.16, min_s=8)       |       2 |                     100.0% |    0.9833 | Klaster renggang dibuang jadi noise!\nDBSCAN(eps=0.30, min_s=8)       |       1 |                     100.0% |    0.5701 | Klaster renggang dibuang jadi noise!\nDBSCAN(eps=0.55, min_s=8)       |       2 |                      41.7% |    0.4460 | Klaster rapat 0 & 1 melebur jadi satu!\nDBSCAN(eps=0.95, min_s=8)       |       2 |                       6.7% |    0.5392 | Klaster rapat 0 & 1 melebur jadi satu!\nHDBSCAN(min_cl=25, min_s=8)    |       3 |                       0.0% |    0.9792 | Menang lintas densitas tanpa eps!",
