          "starterCode": "import numpy as np\n\ndef dbscan_roles_summary(X, eps: float, min_samples: int) -> tuple[int, int, int, int]:\n    X = np.asarray(X, dtype=float)\n    n = X.shape[0]\n    # TODO: hitung matriks jarak -> identifikasi core points -> BFS ekspansi klaster -> hitung (n_clusters, n_core, n_border, n_noise)\n    pass\n\nX_s = np.array([\n    [0.0, 0.0], [0.2, 0.0], [0.0, 0.2], [0.2, 0.2], [0.55, 0.1],\n    [3.0, 0.0], [3.2, 0.0], [3.0, 0.2], [3.2, 0.2], [2.62, 0.1],\n    [1.5, 2.5], [5.0, -2.0],\n])\nprint(dbscan_roles_summary(X_s, eps=0.40, min_samples=4))",
