          "code": "import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2210)\n\n# 1) Bukti Empiris Hukum Konsentrasi Jarak Euclidean Saat d -> tak hingga\n#    Untuk X, Y ~ N(0, I_d): ||X-Y||_2^2 ~ 2 * chi2_d -> CV(D) ~ 1 / sqrt(2d) -> 0!\nn_pts = 180\nprint(\"=== 1. Fenomena Konsentrasi Jarak Euclidean (Beyer et al. 1999) Lintas Dimensi d ===\")\nprint(\"Dimensi d | Rel Contrast (Dmax-Dmin)/Dmin | Empiris CV(D) | Teori 1/sqrt(2d) | Vol Kulit Luar 5%\")\nprint(\"-\" * 98)\nfor d in [2, 8, 32, 128, 384, 768]:\n    X = rng.standard_normal((n_pts, d))\n    # Jarak dari titik referensi X[0] ke 179 titik lainnya\n    dists = np.linalg.norm(X[1:] - X[0], axis=1)\n    d_min, d_max = float(np.min(dists)), float(np.max(dists))\n    rel_contrast = (d_max - d_min) / d_min\n    emp_cv = float(np.std(dists) / np.mean(dists))\n    theo_cv = float(1.0 / np.sqrt(2.0 * d))\n    shell_vol = 100.0 * (1.0 - (0.95 ** d))\n    print(f\"{d:9d} | {rel_contrast:29.4f} | {emp_cv:13.4f} | {theo_cv:16.4f} | {shell_vol:16.2f}%\")\n\n# 2) Verifikasi Eksak Identitas Bola Satuan: ||x_hat - y_hat||_2^2 == 2 * (1 - cos(x, y))\nE = rng.standard_normal((120, 384))\n# Beri variasi panjang magnitudo 1x..10x (meniru panjang dokumen / frekuensi kata embedding)\nscales = rng.uniform(1.0, 10.0, size=(120, 1))\nE_unnorm = E * scales\nE_unit = E_unnorm / np.linalg.norm(E_unnorm, axis=1, keepdims=True)\n\ncos_sim = E_unit @ E_unit.T\ncos_dist = 1.0 - np.clip(cos_sim, -1.0, 1.0)\neuclid_sq_unit = np.sum((E_unit[:, None, :] - E_unit[None, :, :]) ** 2, axis=2)\n\nmax_identity_err = float(np.max(np.abs(euclid_sq_unit - 2.0 * cos_dist)))\nprint(\"\\n=== 2. Verifikasi Identitas Ekuivalensi Cosine & Euclidean pada L2-Unit Sphere (384D) ===\")\nprint(f\"Max | ||x_hat - y_hat||_2^2 - 2*(1 - cos(x, y)) | = {max_identity_err:.2e}  (Identik eksak!)\")",
          "expectedOutput": "=== 1. Fenomena Konsentrasi Jarak Euclidean (Beyer et al. 1999) Lintas Dimensi d ===\nDimensi d | Rel Contrast (Dmax-Dmin)/Dmin | Empiris CV(D) | Teori 1/sqrt(2d) | Vol Kulit Luar 5%\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n        2 |                       41.4683 |        0.5293 |           0.5000 |             9.75%\n        8 |                        2.6733 |        0.2157 |           0.2500 |            33.66%\n       32 |                        0.7014 |        0.1099 |           0.1250 |            80.63%\n      128 |                        0.3804 |        0.0521 |           0.0625 |            99.86%\n      384 |                        0.1745 |        0.0332 |           0.0361 |           100.00%\n      768 |                        0.1298 |        0.0222 |           0.0255 |           100.00%\n\n=== 2. Verifikasi Identitas Ekuivalensi Cosine & Euclidean pada L2-Unit Sphere (384D) ===\nMax | ||x_hat - y_hat||_2^2 - 2*(1 - cos(x, y)) | = 2.22e-15  (Identik eksak!)",
