          "id": "code-ml-22-4-ch22_4_sklearn",
          "title": "Scikit-Learn 1.9: Benchmark Embedding 384D (Raw DBSCAN vs Raw HDBSCAN vs L2-Norm vs Spherical PCA + HDBSCAN)",
          "language": "python",
          "filename": "22_4_sklearn_384d_embedding_benchmark.py",
          "code": "import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.cluster import DBSCAN, HDBSCAN\nfrom sklearn.decomposition import PCA\nfrom sklearn.metrics import adjusted_rand_score\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import Normalizer\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2211)\n\n# Bangkitkan Embedding Semantik 384D Realistis Ber-Noise Latar Dimensi Tinggi:\n# 5 topik semantik (80 dok/topik) + noise isotropik 384D (sigma=0.145 -> konsentrasi jarak!) + variasi norma L2 (1.5..9.5) + 32 OOD\nd_emb = 384\nk_topics = 5\nn_per = 80\nn_ood = 32\n\ntopic_dirs = rng.standard_normal((k_topics, d_emb))\ntopic_dirs /= np.linalg.norm(topic_dirs, axis=1, keepdims=True)\n\nembs_in = []\nfor c in range(k_topics):\n    raw_dir = topic_dirs[c] + rng.normal(0.0, 0.145, size=(n_per, d_emb))\n    raw_dir /= np.linalg.norm(raw_dir, axis=1, keepdims=True)\n    magnitudes = rng.uniform(1.5, 9.5, size=(n_per, 1))\n    embs_in.append(raw_dir * magnitudes)\n\n# 32 dokumen outlier dari 32 arah tak terkait dengan norma bervariasi\nood_dir = rng.standard_normal((n_ood, d_emb))\nood_dir /= np.linalg.norm(ood_dir, axis=1, keepdims=True)\nood_embs = ood_dir * rng.uniform(1.5, 9.5, size=(n_ood, 1))\n\nX_384 = np.vstack(embs_in + [ood_embs])\ny_in = np.repeat(np.arange(k_topics), n_per)\n\n# Pipeline 1 (Anti-Pattern): DBSCAN Euclidean mentah pada 384D (eps=0.5)\nlbl_db_raw = DBSCAN(eps=0.5, min_samples=10, metric=\"euclidean\").fit_predict(X_384)\n\n# Pipeline 2: HDBSCAN Euclidean mentah pada 384D (tanpa L2-norm & tanpa reduksi dimensi)\nlbl_hdb_raw = HDBSCAN(min_cluster_size=25, min_samples=8, metric=\"euclidean\", copy=False).fit_predict(X_384)\n\n# Pipeline 3: L2-Normalizer -> HDBSCAN langsung di 384D (Cosine tanpa reduksi dimensi)\nX_unit = Normalizer(norm=\"l2\").fit_transform(X_384)\nlbl_hdb_unit = HDBSCAN(min_cluster_size=25, min_samples=8, metric=\"euclidean\", copy=False).fit_predict(X_unit)\n\n# Pipeline 4 (Standar Produksi 2026): L2-Norm -> PCA(12D) -> L2-Norm (Spherical PCA) -> HDBSCAN\n# Catatan: PCA membuang 372 dimensi noise latar; re-normalisasi L2 menjaga geometri Cosine untuk OOD!\nX_pca12 = PCA(n_components=12, random_state=42).fit_transform(X_unit)\nX_pca12_sph = Normalizer(norm=\"l2\").fit_transform(X_pca12)\nlbl_hdb_pca12 = HDBSCAN(min_cluster_size=25, min_samples=8, metric=\"euclidean\", copy=False).fit_predict(X_pca12_sph)\n\ndef summarize(name: str, lbl: np.ndarray):\n    k_found = len(set(lbl) - {-1})\n    ari = float(adjusted_rand_score(y_in, lbl[:400]))\n    ood_rec = 100.0 * float(np.mean(lbl[400:] == -1))\n    in_noise = 100.0 * float(np.mean(lbl[:400] == -1))\n    print(f\"{name:42s} | K={k_found:2d} | ARI(In)={ari:.4f} | OOD Rec={ood_rec:5.1f}% | Inlier -1={in_noise:5.1f}%\")\n\nprint(\"=== Benchmark Clustering Embedding 384D (5 Topik + 32 OOD, Norma 1.5..9.5, Noise 384D) ===\")\nsummarize(\"1. Raw Euclidean DBSCAN(eps=0.5) 384D\", lbl_db_raw)\nsummarize(\"2. Raw Euclidean HDBSCAN 384D\", lbl_hdb_raw)\nsummarize(\"3. L2-Norm + HDBSCAN 384D (Tanpa Reduksi)\", lbl_hdb_unit)\nsummarize(\"4. L2-Norm + PCA(12D) + L2 + HDBSCAN\", lbl_hdb_pca12)",
          "expectedOutput": "=== Benchmark Clustering Embedding 384D (5 Topik + 32 OOD, Norma 1.5..9.5, Noise 384D) ===\n1. Raw Euclidean DBSCAN(eps=0.5) 384D      | K= 0 | ARI(In)=0.0000 | OOD Rec=100.0% | Inlier -1=100.0%\n2. Raw Euclidean HDBSCAN 384D              | K= 0 | ARI(In)=0.0000 | OOD Rec=100.0% | Inlier -1=100.0%\n3. L2-Norm + HDBSCAN 384D (Tanpa Reduksi)  | K= 4 | ARI(In)=0.1797 | OOD Rec=100.0% | Inlier -1= 50.0%\n4. L2-Norm + PCA(12D) + L2 + HDBSCAN       | K= 5 | ARI(In)=0.9937 | OOD Rec= 93.8% | Inlier -1=  0.5%",
          "actualOutput": "=== Benchmark Clustering Embedding 384D (5 Topik + 32 OOD, Norma 1.5..9.5, Noise 384D) ===\n1. Raw Euclidean DBSCAN(eps=0.5) 384D      | K= 0 | ARI(In)=0.0000 | OOD Rec=100.0% | Inlier -1=100.0%\n2. Raw Euclidean HDBSCAN 384D              | K= 0 | ARI(In)=0.0000 | OOD Rec=100.0% | Inlier -1=100.0%\n3. L2-Norm + HDBSCAN 384D (Tanpa Reduksi)  | K= 4 | ARI(In)=0.1797 | OOD Rec=100.0% | Inlier -1= 50.0%\n4. L2-Norm + PCA(12D) + L2 + HDBSCAN       | K= 5 | ARI(In)=0.9937 | OOD Rec= 93.8% | Inlier -1=  0.5%",
          "explanation": "Menguji 4 pipeline pada embedding 384D ber-norma tak seragam + 32 dokumen OOD: Raw DBSCAN & Raw HDBSCAN gagal total (ARI=0.00), L2-Norm 384D tanpa reduksi hanya ARI=0.18, sedangkan L2-Norm -> PCA(12D) -> L2 -> HDBSCAN melesat ke ARI=0.9937 dengan OOD Recall 93.8%.",
