          "solution": "```python\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef highdim_concentration_cosine_audit(X, q_in, q_ood, radius_thresh: float) -> tuple[float, float, bool]:\n    X = np.asarray(X, dtype=float)\n    q_in = np.asarray(q_in, dtype=float)\n    q_ood = np.asarray(q_ood, dtype=float)\n    d_euc = np.linalg.norm(X[1:] - X[0], axis=1)\n    rel_contrast = float((np.max(d_euc) - np.min(d_euc)) / np.min(d_euc))\n    Xu = X / np.linalg.norm(X, axis=1, keepdims=True)\n    qi_u = q_in / np.linalg.norm(q_in)\n    qo_u = q_ood / np.linalg.norm(q_ood)\n    euc_sq = float(np.sum((Xu[0] - qi_u) ** 2))\n    cos_d = float(1.0 - np.dot(Xu[0], qi_u))\n    min_d_in = float(np.min(np.linalg.norm(Xu - qi_u, axis=1)))\n    min_d_ood = float(np.min(np.linalg.norm(Xu - qo_u, axis=1)))\n    ood_ok = bool((min_d_in <= radius_thresh) and (min_d_ood > radius_thresh))\n    return (round(rel_contrast, 4), round(abs(euc_sq - 2.0 * cos_d), 10), ood_ok)\n```"
